{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncanny Tales</strong> is an episodic horror series where the scariest things aren\u2019t monsters or the supernatural, but people themselves. Each episode tells a new chilling story inspired by real-life fears and unsettling situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534240/extras/97cdf779d0cc2cbe5274d32c355af62d.poster.avif?t=1751282169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534240/extras/97cdf779d0cc2cbe5274d32c355af62d.webm?t=1751282169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534240/extras/97cdf779d0cc2cbe5274d32c355af62d.mp4?t=1751282169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Uncanny Tales: Cold Road</strong> \u2013 The first episode of the series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A late evening, a snowstorm, the eve of the New Year holidays\u2026 The protagonist is traveling to her parents\u2019 home for winter break. To avoid traffic jams, she takes a less popular and more isolated road. But the journey turns dangerous \u2013 losing control, she crashes her car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regaining consciousness, she realizes that there\u2019s no signal, and the storm is only getting worse. Her only option is to find help. Leaving the car behind, she ventures into the forest and soon stumbles upon an old house. A kind elderly woman welcomes her inside, offering warmth, hot tea, and a place to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But waking up in the middle of the night to strange noises, she soon realizes\u2014she is not alone in this house\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 A tense and unsettling environment, built through detailed surroundings, eerie sounds, and disturbing details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Realism</strong> \u2013 The horror doesn\u2019t come from monsters, but from people and their hidden secrets. This could happen to anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Episodic format</strong> \u2013 Each story in <i>Uncanny Tales</i> is unique but connected by the theme of everyday fears hiding in plain sight.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534240?t=1751282169","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534240/223397508bdb7ca3dae5cd119d447884b0f8c3f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751282169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534240/3ce6f750ab597576b35ff1725828ac04332fade4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751282169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534240/3ce6f750ab597576b35ff1725828ac04332fade4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751282169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence: The game contains scenes of psychological tension and elements of horror, including moments that can cause feelings of fear and anxiety. Direct physical violence is presented minimally and without excessive graphic detail."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncanny Tales</strong> is an episodic horror series where the scariest things aren\u2019t monsters or the supernatural, but people themselves. Each episode tells a new chilling story inspired by real-life fears and unsettling situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534240/extras/97c